    "en": {
      "trackName": "PrismFlow: Block Puzzle Game",
      "description": "Flow the colors, free your mind.\n\nPrismFlow Block Puzzle is a calm, colorful block puzzle you can play in short sessions or long streaks. Drag pieces onto the board, fill rows and columns, and watch them clear — simple rules, deep scoring.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Three block shapes appear in the tray — drag each one onto the 8×8 board\n• Complete full rows or columns to clear them and earn points\n• Chain clears to build combos and push your score higher\n• Game over when none of the three pieces fit — can you beat your best?\n\nFEATURES\n• Smooth drag-and-drop controls tuned for one-hand play\n• Glossy blocks, satisfying clears, and combo feedback\n• Global leaderboard — compete with players worldwide\n• Daily streak reminders (optional)\n• Multiple languages\n• Play offline anytime; sign in for cloud sync and leaderboard\n\nFREE TO PLAY\nPrismFlow is free with optional ads. You can remove ads or buy continue tokens via in-app purchase. No account required to play.\n\nDownload now and find your flow.\n\nPRISMFLOW PLUS (optional subscription)\nAd-free play, 100 gems and 1 continue token every day. The yearly plan starts with a 7-day free trial; a monthly plan is also available. Payment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. The subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings > Apple Account > Subscriptions.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://prismflow-ec386.web.app/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://prismflow-ec386.web.app/privacy",
      "releaseNotes": "• Blocks now lift the instant you touch them for faster, smoother placing\n• New one-screen Shop: pick an option and buy in one tap\n• Faster leaderboard and performance improvements",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/prismflow-block-puzzle-game/id6784841022?uo=4",
